; ============================================================
; Tic-Tac-Toe  —  STELLAR terminal game  (loads at $4000, VM1)
; VERSION:  v01  (hand-assembled — HW-VERIFIED WORKING 2026-07-06)
; ============================================================
; Human is X, computer is O.  Empty cells show their position
; number 1-9, so the board doubles as the input legend.  The
; board is redrawn after every move.
;
;    1 | 2 | 3
;   ---+---+---
;    4 | X | 6
;   ---+---+---
;    7 | 8 | O
;
; ---- COMPUTER AI (simple heuristic, no minimax) ----
;   1. win   : complete a line with two O + one empty
;   2. block : stop a line with two X + one empty
;   3. center, then a corner, then a side
;
; ---- I/O reuse ----
;   Terminal idioms are copied verbatim from the HW-verified
;   Prime-Gen.lst / Simple-Calc.lst listings for this firmware:
;     C9 OUTCH (Acc.lo->term)   CA NN OUTL (literal char)
;     CB INCH  (term->Acc)      35 01 0X read M(RX)->Acc.lo
;     36 01 0X write Acc.lo->M(RX)
;   PUTS + the line-input reader are the same routines used there.
;   Flow control is LBL/GTL/IFTRUEL for local branches (as in the
;   working apps) and BD/BE CALL/RETURN for subroutines.
;
; ---- SUBROUTINES (relative CALL targets) ----
;   PUTS      0x40b7   print NUL string @RA
;   PUTCELL   0x40cd   print one cell char (Acc=idx)
;   DRAWBOARD 0x40fc   render 3x3 grid
;   READLINE  0x4170   read a line into $4A00
;   READMOVE  0x41aa   prompt/validate move -> idx R4, addr R6
;   SCANLINE  0x4208   scan 8 win-lines for a side (R5)
;   BOARDFULL 0x428f   RD=1 if board full
;   PICKEMPTY 0x42b8   center/corner/side fallback
;
; ---- MEMORY MAP ----
;   $4000..$437B  code (892 bytes)
;   $4700..        strings
;   $4820..$4828   board state (0=empty, 1=X human, 2=O computer)
;   $4840..$4857   win-lines table (8 lines x 3 cell indices)
;   $4A00..        input line buffer
;
; ---- NOTE: Acc high byte ----
;   COPYIMXA ($35) loads only Acc.lo; every read here is preceded
;   by LOADAI 0 ($10 00 00) so full-word compares & the +$0820
;   address math see a clean high byte.
;
; ---- HW-VERIFICATION (confirmed working 2026-07-06) ----
;   [x] Nested BD/BE depth-2 (MAIN->DRAWBOARD->PUTCELL and
;       MAIN->READMOVE->READLINE) runs fine — depth-2 SCRT is OK.
;   [x] $35 read + LOADAI 0 guard behaves correctly on hardware.
;   [x] Pre-pass end marker  F0 00 00  emitted after the last code
;       byte (CD..F0 00 00 are a pair — STELLAR COMMANDS v0061.1C).
; ============================================================


